          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for membership, bespoke blends, and gentle aromatherapy guidance.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --leaf:#556B2F; /* olive */\\n      --terracotta:#B85A3D;\\n      --sand:#F5E9DF;\\n      --deep:#3B2F2F;\\n      --accent:#C8A165;\\n      --muted:rgba(59,47,47,0.06);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --max:1100px;\\n      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sand),#fff 60%);color:var(--deep);line-height:1.45}\\n    header{position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(245,233,223,0.8);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.06);}\\n    .nav{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--leaf),var(--terracotta));display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--sand);font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--deep);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.contact{color:var(--terracotta)}\\n\\n    main{max-width:var(--max);margin:28px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{position:relative;border-radius:18px;padding:40px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(88,129,66,0.06),rgba(184,90,61,0.04));overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.18;pointer-events:none}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;color:var(--deep)}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:#4b3d3d}\\n    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px var(--muted);border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.03)}\\n\\n    /* contact form */\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#3b2f2f}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.08);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:#6b5a55}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--leaf);color:var(--sand);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.06);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px}\\n\\n    /* story & framework */\\n    .stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .story h2,.framework h2{margin-top:0}\\n\\n    /* offers + pricing tease */\\n    .offers{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}\\n    .offer{flex:1 1 220px;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(200,161,101,0.07),rgba(184,90,61,0.03));border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.04)}\\n    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--terracotta);font-size:20px}\\n\\n    /* testimonials */\\n    .testimonials{margin-top:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .quote{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(59,47,47,0.04)}\\n\\n    footer{max-width:var(--max);margin:30px auto;padding:24px;text-align:center;color:#5a4b45}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.stack{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{padding:12px}.brand span{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME:0:2}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:#6b5a55\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Shop</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"contact\\\">Reach</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"reach\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#556B2F\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#B85A3D\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          <pattern id=\\\"p\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 20 L40 20\\\" stroke=\\\"#C8A165\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M20 0 L20 40\\\" stroke=\\\"#C8A165\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n          </pattern>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p)\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"720\\\" cy=\\\"520\\\" r=\\\"160\\\" fill=\\\"#F5E9DF\\\" opacity=\\\"0.7\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n\\n      <div>\\n        <h1 id=\\\"reach\\\">Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you're curious about membership, crafting a bespoke roll-on, or exploring gentle scent rituals, let's find a calm, safe path together. We'll honor your sensitivities and preferences — no promises of cures, only thoughtful aromatherapy guidance.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"stack\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card story\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"our-story\\\">\\n            <h2 id=\\\"our-story\\\">A brief story</h2>\\n            <p>As an aromatherapist practicing in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} blends a reverence for plant aroma with careful safety practices. Favorite habit: mixing a small, seasonal vial inspired by {{FAVORITE_BLEND}} and a warm cup of tea.</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">All consultations emphasize dilution, patch testing, and considerations for pets, pregnancy, and medication interactions. We do not offer medical treatment.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card framework\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"how-it-works\\\">\\n            <h2 id=\\\"how-it-works\\\">How membership works</h2>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A membership keeps things simple: seasonal blends, a quarterly consult, and members-only discounts. Choose convenience and consistent attention to safety and quality.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"offers\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#4b3d3d\\\">Monthly Care</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $18</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#4b3d3d\\\">Quarterly Ritual</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $48</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"offer\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#4b3d3d\\\">Custom Blend</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $95</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">See full pricing</a></p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Let's start a conversation</h3>\\n          <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I'm interested in</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n                <option>Membership</option>\\n                <option>Custom blend</option>\\n                <option>Workshop</option>\\n                <option>Wholesale</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n              <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell me a bit about what you're looking for...\\\"></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a55;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"consent\\\" required> I consent to be contacted about this inquiry.</label>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\" id=\\\"phoneBtn\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <p id=\\\"formNote\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">By submitting you agree we may reach out about memberships and services. We prioritize safety: expect guidance on dilution, patch testing, and if needed, pregnancy or pet-safe alternatives.</p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:24px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Safety & common questions</h2>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Dilution</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We recommend conservative dilutions. We always provide recommended blends and exact ratios for at-home use.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Patch test</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A small skin patch test is standard before new topical blends to check sensitivity.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Pets</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Some essential oils are not pet-safe. We offer pet-friendly alternatives and will not recommend risky oils for homes with animals.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Pregnancy & medication</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We review pregnancy and medication considerations and will adapt recommendations, avoiding claims about treating conditions.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">What people share</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\"><strong>J.</strong> \\\"Thoughtful attention to sensitivity and scent — I felt heard every step of the way.\\\"</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\"><strong>M.</strong> \\\"The membership keeps my home smelling like a quiet season. Practical and gentle.\\\"</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Ready to set a time?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose a chat, book a consult, or tell us about your scent preferences. Memberships are flexible and centered on safe practice.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a> <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a visit</a></p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"text-align:left\\\">\\n          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n          <div><a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          <div><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#6b5a55\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Member-centered aromatherapy. No medical claims are made.</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n\\n    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');\\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      if(!form.reportValidity()) return;\\n      // simple client simulation. Replace action with server endpoint or integrate with your form handler.\\n      const note = document.createElement('div');\\n      note.textContent = 'Thanks — your inquiry was received. We will reply within a few business days.';\\n      note.style.marginTop = '12px';\\n      note.style.padding = '10px';\\n      note.style.borderRadius = '8px';\\n      note.style.background = 'linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#F5E9DF)';\\n      form.parentNode.appendChild(note);\\n      form.reset();\\n    });\\n\\n    document.getElementById('phoneBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){\\n      window.location.href = 'tel:{{PHONE}}';\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page & How to Use — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n\\nThis chunk contains the contact page (contact.html) built for an earthy_warm visual family and a warm_storyteller voice. It is designed for an aromatherapy practitioner membership model.\\n\\nFiles provided in this bundle:\\n- contact.html — ready-to-use static contact page with hero, story, framework, offers, pricing teaser, testimonials, safety FAQ, and CTA.\\n\\nQuick customization checklist:\\n- Replace placeholders: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n- Hook the form: the form currently uses a client-side simulation. Change the <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"> to your backend endpoint, or wire to a serverless function or email service.\\n- Pricing & membership links: links point to pricing.html, book.html, shop.html, etc. Ensure those pages exist in the same site root.\\n\\nAccessibility & safety notes:\\n- The content is intentionally safety-forward: no medical claims are made. The page includes reminders about dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy considerations.\\n- Keep language consistent with non-medical guidance. Any future copy should follow these constraints.\\n\\nStyling & assets:\\n- Visual richness comes from CSS variables, gradients, and an inline SVG pattern. No external fonts or images are required.\\n- Colors are controlled in :root for easy brand tweaks.\\n\\nIntegration tips:\\n- For membership signups, route the form to your membership system or collect basic leads and redirect users to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n- To add analytics or notifications, place scripts before the closing </body> tag and ensure privacy considerations for contact data.\\n\\nDeployment:\\n- Drop contact.html into your static site root or template engine. Replace placeholders server-side or during a build step.\\n\\nIf you need a matching assets/img/pattern.svg or additional pages (index, services, blends, shop, pricing, about, book), request the next chunk and include desired variations for headings and section order — this keeps each page unique and cohesive.\\n\\nThank you for designing a thoughtful, safety-first aromatherapy experience.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
